KONOHAGAKURE — PERSONAL NINJA WAY STATEMENT (NINDO)

Every shinobi is invited to record their personal creed — their "ninja way" — upon registration. This statement is kept in the personal section of the shinobi's file.

Sample statements on file:
- Uzumaki, Naruto: "I never go back on my word. That is my ninja way. One day I will become Hokage and everyone in the village will acknowledge me."
- Rock Lee: "A dropout will surpass a genius through hard work." Under the guidance of Might Guy-sensei.
- Hyuga, Neji (revised): rejection of an unchangeable fate; belief that one can rise beyond one's birth.

The nindo is a personal affirmation, not a binding oath, but shinobi are encouraged to live by the creed they set down.
Recorded by the Administration Building.
